1
00:05:07,826 --> 00:05:13,826
Eliminating Evil Since 1812.

2
00:10:15,652 --> 00:10:21,652
The Brothers Grimm is a adventure, fantasy, action
film directed by Terry Gilliam.

3
00:15:23,478 --> 00:15:29,478
Folklore collectors and con artists, Jake and Will Grimm, travel from village to village
pretending to protect townsfolk from enchanted creatures and performing exorcisms.

4
00:20:31,304 --> 00:20:37,304
However, they are put to the test when they encounter a real magical curse in a
haunted forest with real magical beings, requiring genuine courage.

5
00:25:39,130 --> 00:25:45,130
Wilhelm Grimm, played by Matt Damon.

6
00:30:46,956 --> 00:30:52,956
Jacob Grimm, played by Heath Ledger.

7
00:35:54,782 --> 00:36:00,782
Angelika, played by Lena Headey.

8
00:41:02,608 --> 00:41:08,608
Cavaldi, played by Peter Stormare.

9
00:46:10,434 --> 00:46:16,434
Mirror Queen, played by Monica Bellucci.

10
00:51:18,260 --> 00:51:24,260
Hidlick, played by Mackenzie Crook.

11
00:56:26,086 --> 00:56:32,086
The Brothers Grimm is a 2005 fantasy adventure film directed by Terry Gilliam.

12
01:01:33,913 --> 01:01:39,913
The film stars Matt Damon, Heath Ledger and Lena Headey in a heavily fictional reimagining of the Brothers Grimm
as traveling con artists in Napoleonic French-occupied Germany, during the early 19th century.

13
01:06:41,739 --> 01:06:47,739
The brothers eventually encounter a genuine fairy tale curse which
requires courage instead of their usual bogus exorcisms.

14
01:11:49,565 --> 01:11:55,565
Supporting characters are played by Peter Stormare,
Jonathan Pryce and Monica Bellucci.

15
01:16:57,391 --> 01:17:03,391
The film was a British-Czech international co-production,
with the film being shot in the Czech Republic.

16
01:22:05,217 --> 01:22:11,217
In February 2001, Ehren Kruger sold his spec
script to Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer (MGM).

17
01:27:13,043 --> 01:27:19,043
With Gilliam's hiring as director, the script was rewritten by Gilliam and Tony Grisoni
but the Writers Guild of America refused to credit them for their work.

18
01:32:20,869 --> 01:32:26,869
MGM eventually dropped out as distributor but decided to co-finance The Brothers Grimm with
Dimension Films and Summit Entertainment, while Dimension took over distribution duties.

19
01:37:28,695 --> 01:37:34,695
Gilliam often had feuds with brothers Bob and Harvey Weinstein, which caused the
original theatrical release date to be delayed nearly ten months.

20
01:42:36,521 --> 01:42:42,521
The Brothers Grimm was finally released on 26 August 2005 to mixed reviews
and grossed $105.3 million at the worldwide box office.

21
01:47:44,347 --> 01:47:50,347
The film explores themes of sibling relationship, germany,
literature, brothers grimm, con artist.

22
01:52:52,173 --> 01:52:58,173
The tone is lighthearted and intense.
